    "text": "<p>The increasing order of the reactivity of the following with <math><mtext>L</mtext><mtext>i</mtext><mtext>A</mtext><mtext>l</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> is:<br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"111\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3b86c25f-23d2-42de-b986-ddd5132df883-image.png\" width=\"205\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"110\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f0f6a173-abef-43bc-975a-8d8852ab2c91-image.png\" width=\"221\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"109\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e655e67d-5eb9-4fb3-a234-b49b8187584a-image.png\" width=\"181\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <img height=\"112\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/80425619-d290-4f51-9c0c-2718bf849a43-image.png\" width=\"320\" /></p>",
