  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In the mentioned structures&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> will get added to the carbon having slight positive charge.<br /><br />Presence of <math><mtext>C</mtext><mtext>l</mtext></math> increases the positive charge whereas an electron donating group like <math><mtext>N</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> decreases the tendency.<br /><br />Rate of reaction <math><mo>&#8733;</mo></math> <math><mo>-</mo><mtext>M</mtext></math> or <math><mo>-</mo><mtext>I</mtext></math> group<br /><br />Rate of reaction <math><mo>&#8733;</mo></math> <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext>M</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Hence, the correct order will be:<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b5c0226c-a62e-42a7-8d33-561f2092b726-image.png\" style=\"width: 565px; height: 141px;\" /></p><p><img height=\"142\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e8c61ef6-c2c1-4121-8e4b-9a055c04bd3f-image.png\" width=\"450\" /></p>",
